@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@validMovieId = 67e5de6a-a5f8-4401-9188-1fe33987717f
@missingMovieId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@invalidMovieId = not-a-uuid

### Obtener todas las peliculas
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies

### Filtrar por genero
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?genre=Comedy

### Obtener una pelicula 
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{validMovieId}}


### Crear una pelicula valida
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "PilloBatman",
    "year": 2020,
    "director": "John Doe",
    "duration": 120,
    "poster": "https://i.ebayimg.com/images/g/yokAAOSw8w1YARbm/s-l1200.jpg",
    "genre": ["Comedy"]
}

### Excepcion: crear una pelicula invalida
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "",
    "year": 1800,
    "director": "John Doe",
    "duration": -10,
    "poster": "not-a-valid-url",
    "genre": ["action"]
}

### Actualizar una pelicula valida
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{validMovieId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "testBat",
    "year": 2020

}

### Excepcion: actualizar con id invalido
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{invalidMovieId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "test"
}

### Excepcion: actualizar con id inexistente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{missingMovieId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "test"
}

### Eliminar una pelicula valida
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{validMovieId}}


